UID:10059774-1777667400-1777678200@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Juke Joint Blues w/ All Crawfish Go to Heaven
DESCRIPTION:With foot stomping bluesy drones\, heartfelt vocals\, and a crunchy arch top guitar\, All Crawfish Go to Heaven bring blues in the tradition of the greats hailing from Fat Possum Records\, like RL Burnside\, Junior Kimbrough\, Fred McDowell\, amongst others. This trio — Scott Dennis\, Will Arledge\, and Curt Arledge — is guaranteed to get your hips shaking. \nMusic 8:30-11:30pm $10 cover at the door. \nJack Of The Wood is still a downtown hot spot for food\, brews and drink since 1997 and founders Joan and Joe Eckert who still own it\, have maintained the original lively English and Irish vibe. The old-time mountain and Irish music jams continue\, including a hot bluegrass jam Thursdays and brunch every Sunday. The venue extends a welcoming feeling to regulars and newcomers to this day. https://jackofthewood.com/
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/juke-joint-blues-w-all-crawfish-go-to-heaven/
LOCATION:Jack Of The Wood\, 95 Patton Ave\, asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Screenshot-2026-04-28-072719-e1777375696318.png
GEO:35.5944492;-82.5558221
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Jack Of The Wood 95 Patton Ave asheville NC United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=95 Patton Ave:geo:-82.5558221,35.5944492
END:VEVENT
