SUMMARY:Crowbar Presents: Asheville BuskerFest Official Pre-Party ft. Candler Rice
DESCRIPTION:We’re beyond excited to be a partner and home of the official pre-party for the first ever Asheville BuskerFest !!!\n\n\nCandler Rice will be lighting up the stage from 9-12 on Friday 5/1 to kick off an amazing weekend in downtown Asheville!\n\n\n\nThe Crowbar – Asheville’s Best Flockin’ Bar 🐦‍⬛Live Music Every Thursday & Saturday 🎶Sun – Thurs | 1pm to 1amFri – Sat | 1pm to 2am \nDrinks\, Snacks\, Games\, Live Music\, DJ’s\, Karaoke\, More
